  SpeakerName: 'Ending F: Small Flying Targets'
  SpeakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 69db653b1f999eb44866dccb33e341e1, type: 3}
  DialogueText: You conjure a gold coin between each of your fingers with a flash
    of light, before tossing them up in the air, between you and a tree. Before they
    hit the ground, you swing your arms forward as icicles impale the coins and stick
    to the tree. It seems the boy really enjoyed your routine!
